        <body>
            <div xml:id="d119">

                <pb facs="0154" n="120" sameAs="frus:frus1897/pg120"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Risley to Mr. Sherman.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Copenhagen</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1897-10-14"><hi rendition="#italic">October 14, 1897</hi></date>.
                        (Received Oct. 30, 1897.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 179.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inclose herein a letter
                    to Mr. Fred. A. Nielsen, of 669 North Campbell avenue, Chicago, in reply to one
                    from him. As the matter may involve further action, I think it proper to send my
                    reply to the Department, to be forwarded to him only in case of your approval of
                    what has been written.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">John E. Risley.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d119-a1.xml" xpointer="d119-a1"/>
            </div>
